  "contract_version": "1.1.0-draft",
  "description": "Section 6: on import EVERY trigger is created disabled, with a fresh secret and no targets, whatever the bundle said — enabling one is an explicit local act. The webhook HMAC secret, target_devices and run statistics never travel. A note tells the operator what to set before enabling.",
